      "scenes": [
        {
          "audio": "Now, things have improved quite a lot. By taking that hour and a half long interview...",
          "label": "Opening Hook",
          "visual": "A stylized digital animation of a dark software interface centered on a clean white background. A progress bar at the bottom is nearly empty. The lighting is perfectly even and flat with no shadows. The color palette is dominated by dark charcoal gray and stark white. A cursor is not yet visible.",
          "shot_type": "Wide Shot",
          "scene_number": 1,
          "timestamp_end": "0:03",
          "timestamp_start": "0:00"
        },
        {
          "audio": "...and using two prompts, it can be rough-cut into ten minutes.",
          "label": "Product Information",
          "visual": "The interface updates with a motion graphics transition. Small text blocks appear on the top left of the window. The progress bar at the bottom rapidly fills from left to right, changing the indicated duration value. The background remains white and static.",
          "shot_type": "Wide Shot",
          "scene_number": 2,
          "timestamp_end": "0:05",
          "timestamp_start": "0:03"
        },
        {
          "audio": "But in the end, you still need to go through it once yourself to adjust the positions and switch the shots.",
          "label": "Usage Scenarios",
          "visual": "A white cursor enters the frame from the bottom right and hovers over the progress bar area. A new button appears on the top right. The cursor clicks on one of the segments in the progress bar, simulating a user interacting with video editing software. The overall camera position is static.",
